217 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 149 0 R
/E (The program has rapidly gained popularity across Minnesota since its launch. Because the program began in late October 2023, initial awareness and participation were limited. However, demand has grown significantly, with the program reaching its annual contribution cap of around $11.65 million dollars each year after 2023.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
218 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 149 0 R
/E (In 2023, only 15 developers received contributions Since then, participation has doubled to 33 developers, and nearly 116 affordable housing projects have received partial or full SHTC funding. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
