/P 153 0 R
/E (The distribution of SHTC funding shows a clear geographic imbalance between the Twin Cities metro area and Greater Minnesota. Looking at the program from 2024 onward, when it became fully operational, funding allocated to Metro/Twin Cities projects increased steadily each year, while funding for Greater Minnesota projects is seeing a yearly decline.  Aggregating all years,  projects in the Twin Cities have receive approximately 2.5 times more funding than projects in Greater Minnesota. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [2]
>>
