/E (A larger number of projects in Greater Minnesota have received SHTC funding compared to Twin Cities \(88 projects vs 28 projects, respectively\). However, Greater Minnesota projects have overall received a lower share of SHTC dollars compared to Twin Cities Projects  \($11.2 million vs $28.4 million, respectively\). )
